      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedance 2.0",
        "A whole apple and a whole orange fly in simultaneously from opposite sides of the frame at high velocity and collide directly at the center. On impact both fruits explode outward with the apple bursting into a spray of green and red skin fragments, white flesh chunks, and a mist of apple juice, while the orange simultaneously shatters into pulp, peel shards, and a burst of bright citrus juice. The two juice clouds billow and bleed into each other at the center in a slow hanging mist. Shot against a pure black seamless background. Soft directional studio light from above catching every fragment and juice droplet mid-air. Ultra slow motion, every phase of the impact visible — compression, burst, spray, and settle. Camera completely static. One continuous take, no cuts.",
        "720p",
        "16:9",
        8,
        true,
        259718647,
        "randomize",
        false
